			"notes": "- Documentation now always generates.\n- Documentation is now generated on a separate thread.\n- The `item` method can now find items using their namespace id. e.g. `item(\"minecraft:ingot_iron\")`\n- Improved the performance of the `item` method when using an item's translation key.\n- Added `ModId` and `Namespace` fields to `LuaItem` for getting the namespace defined in the item's namespace ID.\n- Added `RegistryName` and `NamespaceID` fields to `LuaItem` for getting the namespace ID of the item.\n- Added `Tag` field to `LuaItem` to get the item's NBT data.\n- Added `HasData` method to `LuaItem` to check if the item has a non-empty NBT data.\n- Added `WithTag` method to `LuaItem` to give the item custom NBT data.\n- Added the `LuaTag` class for dealing with NBT data."
		},
